## Model card

- **Name:** Qwen 3.6 Plus
- **Short description:** Alibaba’s Qwen 3.6 Plus is described in local metadata as a hosted vision-language MoE model for real-world agents and coding, now superseded by newer Qwen 3.7/3.8 tiers.
- **Provider / access:** Alibaba Cloud / Qwen hosted surfaces (per local metadata). Local metadata lists `opencode/qwen-3.6-plus` and `noFreeId`.
- **Release / knowledge:** Release and knowledge cutoff not independently verified from accessible official public sources in this pass.
- **IDs:** `qwen-3.6-plus`.
- **Context window:** 1,000,000 (1M); 65K out (local metadata).
- **Modalities:** Text, image, video input; text output (local metadata).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** Tiered pricing listed in local metadata (e.g. $0.50/$3.00 per 1M <=256K input, higher above 256K, reseller variants); OpenRouter lists $0.325/$1.95 per 1M for `qwen/qwen3.6-plus` in its llms.txt, but not independently verified as a complete official rate card in this pass.
- **Architecture:** 397B-A17B MoE per local metadata; not independently verified in this pass.

